  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a bard gains experience, he learns a number of talents that assist him in manipulating his songs and class features. At 2nd level and every two levels thereafter, a bard gains one song talent. A bard cannot select an individual talent more than once. Talents marked with an asterisk add effects to a bard's song-performing ability, and only one of these talents can be applied to an individual song, with the decision made before the song is performed.</p>",
